    {
        "content": "<p>Hi! My name is Eduardo and I am new to <em>both</em> Lean and Zulip, so I apologize if I am not writing this message in the correct channel. I am currently working through <em>Mathematics in Lean</em>. What is the correct place to ask questions about this?</p>",
        "id": 611845215,
